<title>USA: Laurel Cty SDFC, Ky. won by Nike Sec.</title>
<headline>Laurel Cty SDFC, Ky. won by Nike Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities said it won $4.9 million of Laurel Cty Sch Dist Finance Corporation, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.66 percent.</p>
</text>
